    "Notes!about": {
      "fontSize": 13,
      "text": "# Boreas showcase drive\n\n20 seconds at a busy Toronto intersection (wait, pull away, turn left), every sensor at full rate:\n128-beam LiDAR (10 Hz, all points), 5 MP camera with calibration, Navtech radar,\nGNSS/INS, and 3D boxes for every car, pedestrian and cyclist.\n\n## Things to try\n- [ ] Click a box in the 3D panel: the Watch row and the Perception plot follow it.\n- [ ] Move the track slider on the Perception tab to inspect any track.\n- [ ] Open the Health tab and seek to a camera frame gap.\n- [ ] Edit the Ride comfort script on this tab; its plot updates live.\n- [ ] Sort the tracks table by speed.\n\n## Formats in this file\nEvery topic uses a different encoding, so each panel below is fed by a different decoder.\n\n| Panel | Topic | Encoding |\n|---|---|---|\n| 3D: LiDAR | `/boreas/lidar` | Cloudini `CompressedPointCloud2` (CDR) |\n| 3D: radar points | `/boreas/radar/points` | ROS 2 msg `PointCloud2` (CDR) |\n| 3D: transforms | `/boreas/tf`, `/boreas/tf_static` | ROS 2 IDL `TFMessage` (CDR) |\n| 3D: boxes, trails, route | `/boreas/objects`, `…/trails`, `/boreas/route` | JSON Schema `SceneUpdate` |\n| Image: camera | `/boreas/camera/image` | Protobuf `CompressedVideo` (H.265) |\n| Image: calibration | `/boreas/camera/calibration` | ROS 2 msg `CameraInfo` (CDR) |\n| Image: projected boxes | `/boreas/camera/annotations` | JSON Schema `ImageAnnotations` |\n| Image: radar | `/boreas/radar/image` | ROS 1 `CompressedImage` |\n| Map: position | `/boreas/gps` | FlatBuffers `LocationFix` |\n| Map: route | `/boreas/map/route` | JSON Schema `GeoJSON` |\n| Gauges, plots | `/boreas/motion` | OMG IDL `boreas::Motion` (CDR) |\n| Yaw rate plot | `/boreas/imu` | Cap'n Proto `Imu` |\n| State Transitions | `/boreas/vehicle/state` | CBOR with JSON Schema enums |\n| Object plot, Watch | `/boreas/perception/stats` | MessagePack, no schema |\n| Tracks table | `/boreas/objects/tracks` | JSON, no schema |\n| Pie Chart | `/boreas/objects/class_counts` | ROS 2 msg `float32[]` (CDR) |\n| Diagnostics | `/diagnostics` | ROS 1 `DiagnosticArray` |\n| Log | `/rosout` | ROS 2 msg `rcl_interfaces/Log` (CDR) |\n\nThe container mixes zstd, lz4 and uncompressed chunks with overlapping time ranges, and\ncarries a calibration YAML and a README as attachments (Source Info panel).\n\n## Credits\nBoreas: A Multi-Season Autonomous Driving Dataset. Keenan Burnett et al.,\nUniversity of Toronto. CC BY 4.0.\nhttps://www.boreas.utias.utoronto.ca/ · https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\n\nAdapted for Lichtblick: boxes interpolated between the 5 Hz labels and stitched across\nthe dataset's 20-second tracking segments; dynamics, logs and diagnostics derived from\nthe recorded data.\n"
    }
  },
